<title>USA: Choice Hotels stake raised by Baron.</title>
<headline>Choice Hotels stake raised by Baron.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group controlled by New York investor Ronald Baron said Monday it has raised its stake in Choice Hotels Holdings Inc to 20.1 percent or 12,593,783 common shares from a last reported 18.6 percent or 11,708,883 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Baron said his group acquired shares of the Silver Spring, Md, company between May 21 and June 16 at $14.94 to $16.25 each.</p>
